     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to basic services delivery
- capacity development support on gender based violence prevention provided to JCC via LOA
- 9 water treatment plants (WTP) in Basra rehabilitated

Livelihood support for economic recovery during COVID-19 crisis
- 28 people are provided with business training and small grants
- 5 local solutions are supported to provide quick economic recovery response</narrative>
      </comment>
